      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::web::010::results"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "At ambient temperature, the SCCP-treated tungsten-based refractory HEA has greater strength and uniform tensile elongation than its as-cast baseline.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC10213035::web::010::results"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The SCCP treatment improves uniform deformation under high-strain-rate impact loading.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The claimed combination of improved ductility, retained strength, and retained energetic performance persists at temperatures up to about 800 degrees Celsius.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The nanoprecipitates obstruct dislocation motion and thereby retain high strength.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::web::010::results"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coherent SCCP interfaces facilitate dislocation transmission.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coherent SCCP interfaces relieve stress concentrations that otherwise promote premature crack initiation.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The SCCP microstructure promotes continuous dislocation glide and sustained uniform strain hardening.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC10213035::web::010::results"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The dual precipitate structure improves uniform ductility without loss of yield or ultimate tensile strength.",
